#&ldquo;Android Running Perfectly on an EeePC Netbook. Totally Mad.&rdquo;
This just totally blew me away. I grabbed the ISO of Android X86, "burned" it onto USB stick, booted it on an ancient 700Mhz EeepC 701 Surf and 5 minutes after the initial download, it was running. Almost flawlessly.
Only issues I've run into so far are Wifi giving a bit of grief (LAN fine) and some text entry playing silly buggers. There is also no Android Market but there are ways around that.&nbsp;
&nbsp;
